definition.raw:
we define the norm :
$$ \norm{f}_{H^s_{per}}^2 = \sum_{k\in \mathbb Z} \Big( (1+k\pi^2) \Big)^s |b_k(f)|^2 $$
With $ \displaystyle b_k(f) = \frac{1}{\sqrt{2}} \int_{-1}^{1} f(x) e^{-i\pi k x} dx $ is the coefficient of the Fourier series expansion of $f$. We further prove in the following proposition that the family of GPSWFs are also adapted for the approximation of functions in $f \in H^s_{per}$.

\begin{lemma}                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                       \end{lemma}
\begin{proof}                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                              \end{proof}


\begin{proposition}                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                            \end{proposition}

